  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nHeap buffer overflow exists in ConvertWOFF2ToTTF method of woff2_dec.cc file.  \nCode:  \nif (PREDICT_FALSE(!Read255UShort(&file, &table_idx))) {  \n    return FONT_COMPRESSION_FAILURE();  \n}  \nttc_font.table_indices[j] = table_idx;  \nconst Table& table = tables[table_idx];"
